  <div class="panel">
    <span class="lbl">How the pins were placed</span>
    <p>An address is only on this map if a document put it there: a registration card, a directory entry, a deportation record, a testimony that names the street. Where the record gives a building and the family memory gives a different one, both are noted rather than reconciled.</p>
